{"pages":[{"index":0,"markdown":"Bistro Restaurante\n\nBruno Lopez\n\nPhoto - Dec 2024\n\nShare\n\n# PIZZAS BISTRO\n\n29 C W\n\n5 FORMAGGI\n\nQueso mozzarella, chihuahua, azul, feta y cabra.\n\nCAPRICCIOSA\n\nJamón serrano, alcachofa, aceituna negra y champiñón.\n\nFLAMENKUCHEN\n\nBase de crema, tocino y cebolla caramelizada.\n\nQUESO AZUL\n\n*Nuestra Especialidad\nBase de crema, queso azul, espinaca, jamón serrano y laminas de manzana verde.\n\n4 STAGIONI\n\nPepperoni, jamón, tocino y chistorra.\n\nITALIANA\n\nPepperoni, cebolla morada, pimiento verde, aceituna negra y campiñones.\n\nHAWAIANA\n\nJamón y piña.\n\nCAPRESE\n\nEspinacas, jamón serrano y tomate deshidratado.\n\n![img-0.jpeg](img-0.jpeg)\n\nALFREDO PORTOBELLO\n\nBase de crema, laminas de portobello y pollo marinado.\n\nMEXICANA\n\nCebolla morada, pimiento verde y chistorra.\n\nVEGETARIANA\n\nEspinaca, calabaza, campiñón, cebolla morada, pimiento verde y aceituna negra.\n\nOSTRICA\n\nOstión ahumado, tocino y mostaza dijón.\n\nMARGARITA\n\nRebanadas de tomate fresco y albahaca deshidratada.\n\nJAMÓN CON CHAMPIÑONES\n\nPEPPERONI\n\n*Agrega a tu pasta o ensalada\n\nPollo: $65\nCamarón: $75\n\n# ENSALADAS\n\nENSALADA GRIEGA\n\nLechuga, pepino, tomate, cebolla morada, aceituna negra, queso feta y vinagreta balsamico.\n\nENSALADA BISTRO\n\n*Al horno\nTomate, campiñones, pimiento verde, cebolla morada, pera, manzana, calabaza, queso brie y chistorra.\n\nENSALADA BALI\n\nEspinaca, mandarina, arándanos, tomate cherry, cocó rallado, cacahuete y vinagreta de la casa.\n\nENSALADA DE LA SEMANA\n\nCombinación de lechuga y espinaca, arándanos, tomate cherry, campiñón, calabaza, pera, manzana, almendras y queso de cabra.\n\n# PASTAS\n\nCARBONARA\n\n*Extracto de huevo\nSalsa blanca a base de crema y queso parmesano, con un toque de tocino y nuez moscada.\n\nLINGUINNI PARISIENNE\n\nPimientos, campiñones, jamón en salsa cremosa a base de quesos.\n\nPASTA ESPECIAL\n\nSalsa de tomate de la casa, campiñones, chistorra y queso de cabra.\n\nFRADIAVIOLA\n\nCrema de tomate con un toque de chile de árbol, espinacas y queso feta.\n\nFETUCCINI ALFREDO\n\nSalsa Alfredo a base de queso parmesano.\n\n$185\n\n$225\n\n$185\n\n$185\n\n$235\n\n$225\n\n$225\n\n$225\n\n$235\n\nGoogle Maps","images":[{"id":"img-0.jpeg","top_left_x":1431,"top_left_y":978,"bottom_right_x":1619,"bottom_right_y":1365,"image_base64":null,"image_annotation":null}],"tables":[],"hyperlinks":[],"header":null,"footer":null,"dimensions":{"dpi":200,"height":2384,"width":1844},"confidence_scores":null,"blocks":[{"top_left_x":1787,"top_left_y":79,"bottom_right_x":1814,"bottom_right_y":286,"content":"Bistro Restaurante","confidence_scores":null,"type":"header"},{"top_left_x":1750,"top_left_y":79,"bottom_right_x":1779,"bottom_right_y":255,"content":"Bruno Lopez","confidence_scores":null,"type":"header"},{"top_left_x":1694,"top_left_y":79,"bottom_right_x":1718,"bottom_right_y":222,"content":"Photo - Dec 2024","confidence_scores":null,"type":"header"},{"top_left_x":1798,"top_left_y":2136,"bottom_right_x":1827,"bottom_right_y":2341,"content":"Share","confidence_scores":null,"type":"header"},{"top_left_x":1491,"top_left_y":477,"bottom_right_x":1528,"bottom_right_y":721,"content":"# PIZZAS BISTRO","confidence_scores":null,"type":"title"},{"top_left_x":1466,"top_left_y":566,"bottom_right_x":1486,"bottom_right_y":635,"content":"29 C W","confidence_scores":null,"type":"text"},{"top_left_x":1399,"top_left_y":320,"bottom_right_x":1431,"bottom_right_y":477,"content":"5 FORMAGGI","confidence_scores":null,"type":"text"},{"top_left_x":1344,"top_left_y":320,"bottom_right_x":1407,"bottom_right_y":752,"content":"Queso mozzarella, chihuahua, azul, feta y cabra.","confidence_scores":null,"type":"text"},{"top_left_x":1288,"top_left_y":320,"bottom_right_x":1318,"bottom_right_y":484,"content":"CAPRICCIOSA","confidence_scores":null,"type":"text"},{"top_left_x":1229,"top_left_y":320,"bottom_right_x":1292,"bottom_right_y":756,"content":"Jamón serrano, alcachofa